```css
/* Without box-sizing, adding padding GROWS the element:
   width: 200px + padding: 20px = rendered 240px wide */
.broken { width: 200px; padding: 20px; }

/* With box-sizing: border-box, padding is INSIDE the width */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
.fixed { width: 200px; padding: 20px; } /* still 200px wide */
```
Always add `box-sizing: border-box` globally — it is how most developers expect the box model to work.

